%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as SQLite
  participant W as -wal
  participant D as .db
  S->>W: INSERT rows
  Note over W: old rows in -wal
  alt secure_delete OFF
    S->>W: DELETE 5 frames
    Note over S: DontWrite skips 49
  else secure_delete ON
    S->>W: DELETE 54 zeroed
  end
  Note over S,D: secure_delete ON checkpoints
  S->>W: checkpoint PASSIVE
  W->>D: copy zeroed pages
  Note over W: INSERT frames remain
  S->>W: checkpoint TRUNCATE
  Note over W: reset to 0 bytes
